+    },
+    "shouts": {
+      "_how": "In the thick of it (the meter at meterFrom or more) a man of a side firing within `within` metres of the ear calls out, one of his army's byNation.orders less `exclude`, from where he fired: every gapAtLow seconds (a random time in the range) as the meter reaches meterFrom, down to gapAtFull at 1. An army with fewer than fewLines lines waits at least fewLinesGap (two German lines heard every 5 s would be heard as a loop). A man down within onFallWithin of the ear: onFallChance that a comrade calls out 0.6 to 1.2 s later. One voice a side at a time, never cut off (limits.voicesPerSide). An army with no real voices stays silent.",
